  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="8" corresp="#wit-g">And ealle mæssepreostas we biddað ⁊ lærað, þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> hy beorgan heom sylfum wið Godes yrre.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="8" corresp="#wit-g2">⁊ ealle mæssepreostas we biddað ⁊ læreiþ, þæt hy beorgan heom sylfum wið Godes yrre.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="8" corresp="#wit-d">And ealle mæssepreostas we biddað ⁊ lærað þæt hi beorgan heom silfum wið Godes irre.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">And we pray and admonish all priests to guard against incurring the wrath of God.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und alle Priester bitten wir und weisen wir an, dass sie sich selbst vor Gottes Zorne hüten.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And we ask and instruct all priests to guard themselves against God's anger.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
